                <pb facs="0547" n="435" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg435"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5283: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-09-27T06:03:00-04:00"
                            notBefore="1919-09-26T10:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received September 27, 1919, 6:03
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>“400. September 26, 10 a.m. Department’s September 19, 5 p.m.<anchor n="72"
                        xml:id="d457-f1"/> has created very favorable impression with Omsk
                    Government. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
